    "description": {
      "en": "$tscerpi_rate1 is the employer basic old-age (pension) insurance contribution rate applied to Income Group A earnings (up to 1x monthly PSS). Its value (8.55%) matches contributions.md's 'Employer Old Age'/Table 2.58 'Old age - Income group A' row, unchanged across 2022-2025. It is used in tscer_fr/BenCalc as part of the main old-age insurance contribution calculation."
